OL,3,GNEWSAWhat makes this golden eagle chick
OL,4,Aso important?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA golden eagle chick has become the
OL,7,Ffirst to fledge from a nest on a
OL,8,Fmanaged grouse moor in the south of
OL,9,FScotland.
OL,11,FThe bird - Beaky Junior - hatched in a
OL,12,Fnest in a secret location in the Moffat
OL,13,FHills, at a site used for recreational
OL,14,Fgamebird shooting.
OL,16,FIt comes after a Royal Society for the
OL,17,FProtection of Birds (RSPB) report
OL,18,Frevealed that two-thirds of UK
OL,19,Fpersecution incidents involving birds
OL,20,Fof prey had occurred at similar sites.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
